@startuml figure_4_2_functional_architecture_horizontal
title 图 4.2 系统总体功能结构图（横向）\n中医体质辨识与健康管理系统的设计与实现

skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei UI"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangle {
  roundCorner 8
  borderThickness 1
}
skinparam ArrowColor #424242
skinparam nodesep 18
skinparam ranksep 55

left to right direction

rectangle "中医体质辨识与健康\n管理系统的设计与实现" as ROOT #FFF9C4

skinparam rectangle<<port>> {
  BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam rectangle<<mod>> {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}
skinparam rectangle<<admin>> {
  BackgroundColor #FFF3E0
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam rectangle<<amod>> {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
}

rectangle "患者端（前台）" as L_FE <<port>>

rectangle "患者首页" as f1 <<mod>>
rectangle "智能体质测试" as f2 <<mod>>
rectangle "舌象采集与辨识" as f3 <<mod>>
rectangle "测试结果与历史" as f4 <<mod>>
rectangle "药膳推荐" as f5 <<mod>>
rectangle "养生社区" as f6 <<mod>>
rectangle "健康档案" as f7 <<mod>>
rectangle "健康计划" as f8 <<mod>>
rectangle "健康打卡" as f9 <<mod>>
rectangle "健康统计" as f10 <<mod>>
rectangle "智能对话" as f11 <<mod>>
rectangle "全局搜索" as f12 <<mod>>
rectangle "个人中心" as f13 <<mod>>
rectangle "资料维护" as f13a <<mod>>
rectangle "药膳与收藏" as f13b <<mod>>
rectangle "文章与草稿" as f13c <<mod>>
rectangle "消息通知" as f13d <<mod>>

rectangle "管理员端（后台）" as L_AD <<admin>>

rectangle "管理首页" as b1 <<amod>>
rectangle "数据统计" as b2 <<amod>>
rectangle "角色管理" as b3 <<amod>>
rectangle "菜单管理" as b4 <<amod>>
rectangle "系统设置" as b5 <<amod>>
rectangle "设置生效检测" as b6 <<amod>>
rectangle "操作日志" as b7 <<amod>>
rectangle "文章审核" as b8 <<amod>>
rectangle "文章管理" as b9 <<amod>>
rectangle "文章通知中心" as b10 <<amod>>
rectangle "智能对话" as b11 <<amod>>
rectangle "个人信息" as b12 <<amod>>
rectangle "修改密码" as b13 <<amod>>

' 根节点 → 两条业务线；患者端在上、管理端在下（同从左向右阅读）
ROOT -right-> L_FE
ROOT -right-> L_AD
L_FE -[hidden]down- L_AD

' 患者端：标题后横向串联各功能模块
L_FE -right-> f1
f1 -[hidden]right- f2
f2 -[hidden]right- f3
f3 -[hidden]right- f4
f4 -[hidden]right- f5
f5 -[hidden]right- f6
f6 -[hidden]right- f7
f7 -[hidden]right- f8
f8 -[hidden]right- f9
f9 -[hidden]right- f10
f10 -[hidden]right- f11
f11 -[hidden]right- f12
f12 -[hidden]right- f13
f13 -[hidden]right- f13a
f13a -[hidden]right- f13b
f13b -[hidden]right- f13c
f13c -[hidden]right- f13d

' 管理端：标题后横向串联各管理模块
L_AD -right-> b1
b1 -[hidden]right- b2
b2 -[hidden]right- b3
b3 -[hidden]right- b4
b4 -[hidden]right- b5
b5 -[hidden]right- b6
b6 -[hidden]right- b7
b7 -[hidden]right- b8
b8 -[hidden]right- b9
b9 -[hidden]right- b10
b10 -[hidden]right- b11
b11 -[hidden]right- b12
b12 -[hidden]right- b13

legend bottom
  阅读方向从左至右：先根节点，再分「患者端」「管理员端」两条横排功能链；
  「个人中心」右侧为其子功能（横排）。框内为横排文字，便于论文排版。
endlegend

@enduml
